# Netlify redirects. Paths match with or without a trailing slash.

# Alternate domains. Each must also be a domain alias on the Netlify site.
# Netlify redirects http to https before applying these rules, so only https
# rules are needed.
https://nilenso.ai/*        https://nilenso.com/:splat  301!
https://nilenso.ca/*        https://nilenso.com/:splat  301!
https://nilenso.in/*        https://nilenso.com/:splat  301!
https://nilenso.software/*  https://nilenso.com/:splat  301!
https://nilenzo.com/*       https://nilenso.com/:splat  301!

